#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:5
msgid "Line"
msgstr "线条"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:8
msgid "Create line"
msgstr "创建线条"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:12
msgid ""
"To draw more easily, the folio grid can be displayed from **Display > "
"Display the grid** or from `toolbar`_ icon |grid|."
msgstr ""
"为了更方便地绘制，可以通过 **Display > Display the grid** 或 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 上的 |grid| "
"图标显示图幅网格。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:20
msgid "grid"
msgstr "网格"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:14
msgid "A line can only be added to the `workspace`_ by `toolbar`_."
msgstr "线条只能通过 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 添加到 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:16
msgid "Select the icon |line| from `toolbar`_ to add a line."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 中选择 |line| 图标以添加线条。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:21
msgid "line"
msgstr "线条"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:17
msgid "Click on the initial point from the line."
msgstr "单击线条的起点。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:18
msgid "Click on the end point from the line."
msgstr "单击线条的终点。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:25
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Add**."
msgstr "如果未显示 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ ，可以从 **Settings > Display > Add** 中将其显示出来。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:28
msgid "Line properties"
msgstr "线条属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:30
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows customizing the type of line, the thickness from the "
"line and the color of the line."
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许自定义线条的类型、粗细和颜色。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:32
msgid ""
"The different types of lines are: **normal**, **dashed**, **dotted**, **dots"
" and dashes**, **dash dot dot** and **custom dash line**."
msgstr ""
"不同类型的线条有 **normal**, **dashed**, **dotted**, **dots and dashes**, **dash dot"
" dot** 以及 **custom dash line** 等类型。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:37
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Color selection PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 颜色选择弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:39
msgid ""
"The possible line thickness are between 0.2 and 50 mm (0.2, 0.4, 0.8, 0.6, "
"0.8, 1, 1.2, 1.4, ... , 50)."
msgstr ""
"可能的线条粗细范围为 0.2 到 50 mm（0.2, 0.4, 0.8, 0.6, 0.8, 1, 1.2, 1.4, ..., 50）。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:40
msgid "The possible colors are defined by the `RGB scale range`_."
msgstr "可用的颜色由 `RGB 色阶范围 <RGB scale range_>`_ 定义。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:44
msgid ""
"The position from the line can be locked to prevent involuntary movement."
msgstr "可以锁定线条的位置，以避免意外移动。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:46
msgid "Go to line properties and check the **Lock position** button."
msgstr "转到线条属性，勾选 **Lock position** 按钮。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:48
msgid ""
"The line properties can be displayed from `menu bar`_, by right click on the"
" line, from selection properties panel and using keyboard shortcut."
msgstr "线条属性可以通过 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 、右键单击线条、选择属性面板以及键盘快捷键来显示。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:52
msgid "Line properties from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏显示线条属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:54
#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:92
msgid "Select the line which should be edited."
msgstr "选择要编辑的线条。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:55
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Edit the selected object** menu item to display the line "
"properties PopUP window."
msgstr "选择 **Edit > Edit the selected object** 菜单项，以显示线条属性弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:60
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:63
msgid "Line properties by right click"
msgstr "通过右键单击显示线条属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:65
msgid "Right click on the line which should be edited."
msgstr "右键单击要编辑的线条。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:66
msgid ""
"Select the option **Edit the selected object** to display the line "
"properties PopUP window."
msgstr "选择 **Edit the selected object** 选项，以显示线条属性弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:71
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech line selection PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 线条选择弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:74
msgid "Line properties from selection properties panel"
msgstr "从选择属性面板显示线条属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:76
msgid ""
"Select the line which should be edited and the properties from the line will"
" appear at `selection properties panel`_."
msgstr "选择要编辑的线条，线条属性将显示在 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_ 中。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:81
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Line properties panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 线条属性面板"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:85
msgid ""
"If the `selection properties panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed "
"from **Settings > Display > Selection properties**"
msgstr ""
"如果未显示 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_ ，可以从 **Settings > Display > "
"Selection properties** 中将其显示出来。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:88
msgid "Line properties using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键显示线条属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:90
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:93
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + e`` to display the line properties PopUP window."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + e`` 显示线条属性弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/line.rst:97
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcuts, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于 QElectroTech 键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参阅 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
